        {
          "text": " Bangira bati: Abaahonokire batatwarwe omu bukwatwa, abari omuri eryo ishaza, bari omu busaasi bwingi, n'omu kuhemuka kuhango; orugo rw'amabaare orwa Yerusaalemu rusheenyirwe, n'amarembo gaayo gacwekyereziibwe n'omuriro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
