        {
          "text": " Naagira nti: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'eiguru, ori Ruhanga Nyamuhanga orikutiinwa, orinda endagaano kandi ogirira embabazi abakukunda, bakoorobera ebiragiro byawe, ",
